You get interesting messages when you're on the quest as an Archeologist.
There are archeology students running around, and you have to go talk
to your prof.  Try #chatting with the students...

 So you're Lord Carnarvon's prize pupil!  I don't know what he sees in you.
 Hey man, have you got any potions of hallucination for sale?
 ...

Chatting with Lord Carnarvon gave some (slightly) helpful advice.  I'd
bet this is a good thing to do no matter what class you're in.

I think it's great that this level is slightly different depending on
what character type you play.  Makes it more interesting.
